  "body": "## The leap\n\nOne stable organism (Body + append-only cube + eight organs) can now express **many front-facing surfaces** \u2014 a spreadsheet, a CLI, a calculator, a phone shell \u2014 as interchangeable **phenotypes**. A *face* is a whole front-end whose source is **sealed under the genesis key** into a private VCW band. *The Compiler does not run apps; it wears them.* The invariant substrate (nervous system + VCW) never changes; only the swappable layer (the face) does.\n\n## What's here\n\n- **`mantle/phenotype.py`** (modeled on `vault.py`): `express` / `list_faces` / `open_face` / `wear` / `shed` / `active_face`, over two reserved **private** bands \u2014 `phenotypes` (SELF-encrypted source, one ciphertext chunk per layer, large faces span layers) and `phenotype_log` (append-only wear-events) \u2014 plus `snapshot` / `restore` / `rebirth_with_faces` for rebirth survival.\n- **The default (origin) face:** every hatched organism is *born wearing* its own source \u2014 sealed in its VCW from the first breath (from the egg's optional `face` block, or a generated stub). Even with no other face added, the organism always holds an encrypted copy of its origin surface: a self-reconstruction guarantee, the sibling of the seed vault. Faces survive a chosen rebirth (the genesis key persists); the old generation keeps a readable copy in the sealed ancestor.\n- **Four laws** (all proven red/green): SELF-encrypted (OTHER can't read/wear), source never executed here (wearing returns a host boot manifest), append-only (the active face is the latest wear-event), and socket conformance (a face may only plug into controls the nervous system can drive).\n- **CLI:** `face-save` / `face-list` / `face-wear`.\n- **Artifacts:** `eggs/calculator.json` (declares its own origin HTML calculator face) and `examples/phenotype_demo.py` (the whole story end to end).\n\n## Invariants (68 \u2192 73)\n\n- `PHENO-1` SELF opens its own face; source round-trips byte-identical; a tampered seal is refused.\n- `PHENO-2` an OTHER body (different genesis key) cannot read/wear a sealed face.\n- `PHENO-3` wearing is append-only; the active face is the latest event; the cube still coheres.\n- `PHENO-4` the default face is present after birth and survives a chosen rebirth.\n- `PHENO-5` a face may only plug into controls with a socket in the Human Surface Map.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python -m mantle prove` \u2192 **73/73** green (incl. DOCTOR-1 docs-vs-code coherence)\n- `python -m mantle audit` (Stage-1) + `python -m mantle audit-mind` (Stage-2) \u2192 **PASS**; the 3 tamper proofs each exit 1\n- `python -m mantle teach` \u2192 **18/18** chapters (new \"Wearing a Face\")\n- The real 179 KB `Mantle_Spreadsheet_Agent.html` surface round-trips **byte-identical** through the VCW\n- `python examples/phenotype_demo.py` \u2192 all checks; `vcw_cube.py selftest` + `interop.py` \u2192 ALL GREEN\n\n## Format / compat\n\n**COMPAT** \u2014 a new app band + `log-json` entries only; no `core` / `vcw` / `organs` schema change; cube format `vcw-cube-png-v2` unchanged. **`core/organism.py` is untouched** \u2014 rebirth survival lives in `phenotype.rebirth_with_faces`, keeping core pure.\n\n## Design note (intentional)\n\nSELF-encryption was chosen over raw cross-body portability: faces are bound to the organism's genesis key, so a copied nest in a *foreign* body cannot wear them. The Body ABI holds within the organism's own lineage. A portable, signed-but-cleartext face variant remains a possible future option.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
